{"title":"2000 PMWC Problems/Problem T6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/a/01af69044b21ad779380d5362fa085a71b558e50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC=6BD$\" width=\"92\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/2/6623dfff40f19f942a00e2a3a50afe201c9da697.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC=5EC$\" width=\"89\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/e/dee4eef499b5b0a9e443525fc826d386d7b52693.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DG=GH=HE$\" width=\"140\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/0/9a0a143998d56f22551bfbebb93a6a20194cc712.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AF=FG$\" width=\"80\" height=\"13\" />. Find the ratio of the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/2/f722737ea859dab2d8c9e3d24325ecac6c28ac9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle FGH$\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" /> to the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/5/935c4d02cf262e05e775b29a11df5eeb680452d4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] fill((1,2.5)--(0.9,0.72)--(1.82,1.46)--cycle,black); draw((0,5)--(-3,0)--(4,0)--(0,5)--(0,0)); draw((0,0)--(2.5,2)); draw((0,5)--(1,2.5)--(0.9,0.72))